# ── Public site configuration ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are INLINED into the static client bundle by
# Next.js at build time. They are public — never put a secret hereholly.

# URL of the deployed Cloudflare Worker that generates results. The frontend
# (src/lib/config.ts) reads this and POSTs {topic} to it. Required for the
# generator to work on the static GitHub Pages site.
#
# - Local build: set it in .env.local (or export it) before `npm run build`.
# - GitHub Pages: the deploy workflow injects it from the WORKER_URL repository
#   *variable* automatically. You do not normally need to set it here.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WORKER_URL=https://your-worker.your-name.workers.dev
